---
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="页面未找到" noindex><section class="wrap not-found"><p class="error-code" aria-hidden="true">404</p><h1>这一页，还没有写下。</h1><p>链接可能已经移动，也可能是地址拼写有误。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href={withBase('/')}>返回首页 ↗</a><a class="text-link" href={withBase('/search/')}>搜索文章 →</a></div></section></BaseLayout>
